From 6585ce9bf17c3eff0af40982fa0129324fca1f29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Haiku 5.5" <a@b>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:41:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rv1126b: SoC code, Kconfig and common header (1 of 6)

Adds the RV1126B SoC support for U-Boot v2026.10 (AArch64), ported from Rockchip
u-boot-next-dev at 1c535d65:
- arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rv1126b/rv1126b.c: memory map (seed 137-170), debug UART (183-185),
  the sdmmc0 pinmux and SPL card power-cycle as rv1126b_sdmmc0_iomux_init() (seed 188-215;
  mainline has no board_set_iomux hook), STIMER (seed 291-305), storages finish (seed 307-315).
  arch_cpu_init is the minimum: the seed's secure, firewall, TSADC, USB and PHY writes (seed
  417-...) are NOT ported yet.
- Kconfig: ROCKCHIP_RV1126B (seed 722-744, ARM64 by default, as the seed's select does),
  SoC layout defaults with seed line numbers (SPL_TEXT_BASE 0x4fe00000 matches the loader ini
  LOAD_ADDR, RKBOOT/RV1126BMINIALL.ini line 20).
- include/configs/rv1126b_common.h: the SDRAM window and the boot environment layout (seed
  lines 82-86, 109-121). The secure-OTP block (seed 38-93) is not ported.
- Shared code, minimal: ROCKCHIP_SYSCON_IOC appended to the syscon enum in
  arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/clock.h. Existing values do not move.

Build (scratch, aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc, the seed defconfig minus the EVB board, NO_PYTHON=1
because swig is not installed): rv1126b.o and syscon_rv1126b.o build with 0 warnings.
The full defconfig does not link until the board patch (6 of 6).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
